      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 22:23:34",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "In hindsight, it was a mistake for SpaceX to send them thousands of free Starlink dishes and millions of dollars a month in free service at the beginning of the war. \n\nWhat started as internet access for civilians became the backbone for autonomous killing drones. And now if they don’t support military use, they get skewered for it in the press.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "Osint613",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2094762039746936832/f8vexHZ2_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 14:17:04",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-05T06:17:04.000Z",
        "id": "2118226071967396200",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Open Source Intel",
        "text": "Ukrainian President Zelensky on Elon Musk:\n\n\"Having so much power concentrated in the hands of a very rich person is dangerous.\n\nConcentrating power in the hands of one person who doesn't have much money is also dangerous.\n\nThat is the whole point of the separation of powers: making sure that everything is not concentrated in the hands of one person.\"",
        "url": "https://x.com/Osint613/status/2118226071967396200",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "wholemars",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100121110960553984/UWLjAKcu_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 19:18:31",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-05T11:18:31.000Z",
        "id": "2118301931852738730",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Whole Mars Catalog",
        "text": "In hindsight, it was a mistake for SpaceX to send them thousands of free Starlink dishes and millions of dollars a month in free service at the beginning of the war. \n\nWhat started as internet access for civilians became the backbone for autonomous killing drones. And now if they don’t support military use, they get skewered for it in the press.",
