    {
      "id": "2118251594232008714",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-05T07:58:29.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 15:58:29",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "My mindset on @bot has completely changed.\n\nI used to treat them like assistants. Now I treat them like real employees.\n\nWhy: an assistant does what you ask. An employee notices what you didn't ask.\n\nHow:\nHire them for one job.\nOnboard them with a clear brief.\nTrain them when they get it wrong.\nMaintain them as the job changes.\n\nThe moment I stopped asking \"what can this assistant do?\" and started asking \"what could this hire own?\", everything they could do for me got bigger.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "kiaraplds",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2080698898335543296/ekVLOWln_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 00:48:09",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-04T16:48:09.000Z",
        "id": "2118022500244172902",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Kiara @ SpaceX SI",
        "text": "My mindset on @bot has completely changed.\n\nI used to treat them like assistants. Now I treat them like real employees.\n\nWhy: an assistant does what you ask. An employee notices what you didn't ask.\n\nHow:\nHire them for one job.\nOnboard them with a clear brief.\nTrain them when they get it wrong.\nMaintain them as the job changes.\n\nThe moment I stopped asking \"what can this assistant do?\" and started asking \"what could this hire own?\", everything they could do for me got bigger.",
        "url": "https://x.com/kiaraplds/status/2118022500244172902",
        "verified": true,
