    {
      "id": "2118250642926141450",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-05T07:54:43.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 15:54:43",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "A friend signed up for Grok Bot a month ago and was about to cancel. He couldn't see the real value.\n\nHe had 4 bots, but no plugins connected, no routines, and no skills.\n\nI showed him my 25 bots, what each one does, and how I manage the whole team. He was surprised by what Grok Bot can do, and he decided to keep his subscription.\n\nIf you don't know how to orchestrate Grok Bots, you won't see the value.\n\nBusinesses, companies, churches: if you need AI consulting, DM me.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
