            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Shubham Saboo",
        "text": "I have moved everything from OpenClaw, Hermes and Muse to just Grok Bot now. \n\nMuse had a moment for a while. But Grok @bot is coming out as a clear winner for personal agents (UI/UX/features - everything on point). \n\nAnd the most impressive thing the speed of shipping to keep grok bot relevant.\n\nAmazing work @poteto, @mattyp and team!   https://x.com/bot/status/2118043939592942052/video/1",
        "url": "https://x.com/Saboo_Shubham_/status/2118055599036588312",
