    {
      "id": "2118050491188072950",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-04T18:39:23.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-05 02:39:23",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: Vietnam’s Lâm Đồng plans to bring Starlink to areas where poor mobile coverage makes rescue efforts harder.\n\nAround Gia Bắc Pass in Sơn Điền, mountains and deep valleys make it hard to stay connected. During road accidents, floods and landslides, that can make calling for help difficult.\n\nLocal officials are working with FPT Telecom to choose a location for Starlink, helping rescue teams stay connected and organise emergency responses.",
